  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span>
        <h1>Your team types it up. <em>AI can do most of it.</em></h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--pile" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/paper-stack.webp?v=2" alt="" width="560" height="560" /><span class="ph-chip ph-chip--1"><b>Enquiries</b><small>replies drafted</small></span><span class="ph-chip ph-chip--2"><b>Invoices</b><small>captured, not retyped</small></span><span class="ph-chip ph-chip--3"><b>Quotes</b><small>built from the request</small></span><span class="ph-chip ph-chip--4"><b>Same questions</b><small>answered from your files</small></span></figure>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Enquiries, quotes, invoices, documents and the same questions over and over. <b>A person still checks it.</b></p>
        <p class="proof-line"><span><s>~15 min</s> <b>~3 min</b> per enquiry</span><span><b>Under a minute</b> to find a policy answer</span><span><b>Invoices</b> posted as draft bills</span><span class="proof-line__note">Timed on sample work.</span><a class="inline-link" href="ai-demos" data-track="solutions-proof">See them work &rarr;</a></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-solutions-book-top">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="ai-demos" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-solutions-examples">See examples</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="callwhat" aria-label="What happens on the free call"><li>You tell us about the work</li><li>We say honestly if AI fits</li><li>No slides, no pitch</li><li>You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</li></ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ TYPES ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="types" aria-labelledby="typesTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Start with the problem</span>
          <h2 id="typesTitle">Which of these sounds like you?</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="types types--problems reveal">
          <li><a href="#enquiries"><b>Enquiries get answered late, or lost</b><span>Replies drafted for you</span><em>from <span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></em></a></li>
          <li><a href="#library"><b>The same task is typed by hand every week</b><span>Done for you, automatically</span><em>from <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></em></a></li>
          <li><a href="services#dashboards"><b>Nobody sees the whole picture</b><span>A dashboard</span><em>from <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></em></a></li>
          <li><a href="#knowledge"><b>Staff keep asking the same questions</b><span>An assistant that knows your files</span><em>from <span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></em></a></li>
          <li><a href="#data-entry"><b>Our systems don&rsquo;t talk to each other</b><span>Typed once, updated everywhere</span><em>from <span data-zar="45000">R45,000</span></em></a></li>
          <li><a href="services#websites"><b>Customers can&rsquo;t find us or get in touch</b><span>A website that brings in enquiries</span><em>from <span data-zar="12500">R12,500</span></em></a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="cur-line cur-line--inline">Prices in <span class="cur-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show prices in"><button type="button" data-cur="ZAR" aria-pressed="true">ZAR</button><button type="button" data-cur="USD" aria-pressed="false">USD</button><button type="button" data-cur="EUR" aria-pressed="false">EUR</button><button type="button" data-cur="GBP" aria-pressed="false">GBP</button></span></p>
        <p class="small muted reveal" style="margin-top:1rem">Not sure which? That&rsquo;s normal. <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Describe the problem</button> and we&rsquo;ll suggest the simplest thing that works.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ LIBRARY ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="library" aria-labelledby="libTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Work that arrives and gets typed up</span>
          <h2 id="libTitle">Read, sorted and drafted for you.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="sol-grid sol-grid--4">
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="enquiries"><h3>Enquiries</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Reading every email and writing each reply by hand.</s> Replies drafted from your prices and rules, ready to approve.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=enquiries">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="quotes"><h3>Quotes</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Copying details into a template and pricing line by line.</s> A draft quote built from the enquiry, ready to check and send.</p></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="documents"><h3>Invoices &amp; documents</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Retyping invoices and forms into your systems.</s> Read, checked against your records, mismatches flagged.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=invoices">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="triage"><h3>A shared inbox</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Someone sorts it every morning.</s> Each email summarised and sent to the right person, urgent ones first.</p></article>
        </div>

        <div class="section__head reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4rem)">
          <span class="eyebrow">When your systems don&rsquo;t talk</span>
          <h2>Typed once, updated everywhere.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="sol-grid">
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="data-entry"><h3>Typing the same thing twice</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>The same customer keyed into three systems.</s> Entered once, updated everywhere.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=invoices">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="onboarding"><h3>New clients</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Chasing forms and setting them up in each system.</s> Missing documents requested, the client set up everywhere.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=invoices">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="reporting"><h3>Monthly reports</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Exporting, building the same charts, writing the same notes.</s> The report built for you, with a draft of what changed.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=feedback">Try it →</a></article>
        </div>

        <div class="section__head reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4rem)">
          <span class="eyebrow">When answers are hard to find</span>
          <h2>Ask, and get the answer with its source.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="sol-grid">
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="knowledge"><h3>Finding answers</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Digging through files, or asking the one person who knows.</s> Ask in plain words, get the answer and where it came from.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=questions">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="customer-answers"><h3>Customer questions</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>The same questions on WhatsApp, chat and email.</s> Answered day and night; real leads passed to your team.</p><a class="sol__try" href="live-demo?sample=enquiries">Try it →</a></article>
          <article class="sol sol--ba reveal" id="compliance"><h3>Contracts</h3><p class="ex-card__ba"><s>Reading long documents for the dates and clauses that matter.</s> Key terms pulled out, gaps flagged for a person to check.</p></article>
        </div>
        <p class="psr-note reveal">Not on the list? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us what takes too long.</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WHO ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="fitTitle">
      <div class="container band">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Who it&rsquo;s for</span>
          <h2 id="fitTitle">Teams of 5 to 200 that run on email, documents and more than one system.</h2>
          <p class="lead">Law and accounting firms, property agencies, brokers, medical practices, logistics and trades.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ TRY THE REAL ASSISTANT ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="try" aria-labelledby="tryTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Live</span>
          <h2 id="tryTitle">Ask our own assistant.</h2>
          <p>It answers from our own prices and process.<span data-needs-ai> Try to catch it out.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="asst" data-assistant>
            <div class="asst__log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation">
              <div class="asst__msg asst__msg--ai">Hi! Ask me what Re-Charge does, what it costs, or how long it takes.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="asst__chips">
              <button type="button">How does it start?</button>
              <button type="button">What does the monthly fee cover?</button>
              <button type="button">How do you measure the time saved?</button>
              <button type="button">Do you still build websites?</button>
            </div>
            <form class="asst__form">
              <label class="sr-only" for="asstIn1">Ask a question</label>
              <input class="asst__input" id="asstIn1" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ask a question…" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary asst__send">Ask</button>
            </form>
            <p class="asst__note" data-needs-ai>Real AI, not a script. It can be wrong, so check anything important with us.</p><p class="asst__note" data-ai-off>Tap a question for the answer. Anything else goes to a person on WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do we need new software?</summary><p>Usually not. We connect to what you already use.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will it replace our staff?</summary><p>No. It takes the repetitive part, so your people do the work you hired them for.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What if the AI gets something wrong?</summary><p>Where a mistake would matter, a person approves before anything goes out. We check its accuracy every month.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is our data safe?</summary><p>It stays in accounts you own and is used only to run your system. We tell you who handles it before we build.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>From <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span> for one task, or <span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span> for an AI tool. Bigger projects go step by step, and you can stop after each one. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">See all prices</a></p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
                <h2 id="ctaTitle">Bring one process that takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute review. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI is the answer.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-solutions-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="callwhat" aria-label="What happens on the free call"><li>You tell us about the work</li><li>We say honestly if AI fits</li><li>No slides, no pitch</li><li>You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</li></ul>
        <p class="cta__alt">Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Prefer to talk first? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
